Third-party code in this repository keeps its own licence and notices:

- engines/macro.c, macro.h, macro_tables.h: Plaits synthesis by Emilie Gillet
  (Copyright 2016, MIT) as ported to fixed point by the digi1_mods authors (MIT).
  See the header of macro.c. The CHORDS, SWARM, WAVETABLE and VA engines in macro.c
  and the engine selection are additions made here, under the same terms.
- engines/macro_chord_tables.h, macro_wavetable.h: data generated from Plaits
  (pichenettes/eurorack, MIT).
- model-tg-sampler-mode/model-tg-plaits-mode.patch: changes to Model-TG
  (Copyright 2026 TinyGregAudio, MIT).
